; =============================================================================
; ZTC Ballistics — ammo tier assignments (ztc_ammo_tier + k_hit only)
; =============================================================================
; ztc_ammo_tier values:
;   soft | ball | enhanced | ap | ap_amr | buckshot
;
; Script scales tier -> k_ap at fire time by firing weapon kind
; (pistol / smg / rifle / sniper / shotgun). Engine vanilla k_ap is ignored.
; k_hit is unchanged here — damage tier multiplier applied by ballistics script.
;
; Only BASE ammo sections are patched here. Condition variants (_bad,
; _verybad) inherit ztc_ammo_tier / k_hit from their parent via vanilla
; LTX chain. Vanilla impair and k_bullet_speed penalties on _bad/_verybad
; are untouched.
;
; k_air_resistance is NOT modified — per-caliber drag stays vanilla.
; Grenades (vog-25, m209, og-7b) and gauss ammo are intentionally excluded.
; =============================================================================

